mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">3</font></span></b><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span
                                    style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">.</span></b><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">教学方式</font><font
                                        face="Times New Roman">/Teaching Methods</font></span></b><sub><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;
vertical-align:sub;"><font face="仿宋">（应体现实现教学目标所采用的具体策略、方法和组织形式）</font></span></sub><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:66.6500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(255,255,255);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><div>为实现课程教学目标，将综合运用多种教学方式，兼顾理论知识传授与实践能力培养，具体如下：</div>
<ol>
<li><strong>讲授法</strong>：在讲解营养与大脑、能量平衡等基础理论知识时，教师通过系统、条理清晰的讲解，向学生传授饮食行为与心理相关的核心概念、原理和机制，帮助学生构建完整的知识体系。例如，在阐述营养物质对大脑发育与功能的作用时，教师运用专业术语和科学研究成果，详细讲解各类营养素如何通过神经调节、化学分子调节个体饮食行为。</li>
<li><strong>案例分析法</strong>：引入实际案例，包括不同人群的饮食行为案例、病理性饮食行为案例等，引导学生运用所学知识进行分析和讨论。如分析某肥胖群体的饮食行为习惯，探讨其中涉及的心理因素、能量平衡问题以及文化对其饮食偏好的影响，让学生在具体案例中加深对知识的理解和应用能力。</li>
<li><strong>小组讨论法</strong>：针对一些具有争议性或开放性的问题，如如何制定有效的肥胖综合治疗方案、不同文化背景下饮食心理干预策略的差异等，组织学生进行小组讨论。小组成员通过交流观点、分享见解，共同探讨解决方案，培养团队协作能力和批判性思维。</li>
<li><strong>实验与演示法</strong>：在讲解味觉、嗅觉与食欲的关系，以及感官体验对口味偏好和食量的影响时，可通过简单的感官实验，如让学生品尝不同口味的食物、闻不同香气的食材，直观感受感官刺激与饮食心理之间的联系。还可以利用展示大脑神经调节饮食行为的动画过程、肥胖基因作用机制等，增强教学的直观性和趣味性。</li>
<li><strong>翻转课堂</strong>：部分课程提前为学生提供学习资料，如相关的学术论文、视频课程等，让学生在课下自主学习。课堂上则以学生的汇报、讨论和答疑为主，鼓励学生分享自己的学习心得和疑问，教师进行引导和总结，充分调动学生的学习主动性和积极性。</li>
<li><strong>PPT 汇报与展示</strong>：作为重要的教学和评价环节，要求学生围绕课程中的某个主题，如饮食行为干预策略、肥胖治疗案例分析等，制作 PPT 进行汇报展示。学生在准备过程中，需要整合知识、梳理逻辑，在展示过程中锻炼表达能力和沟通能力，同时通过师生之间的互动交流，进一步深化对课程内容的理解。</li>
</ol></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:22.4500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">4.教学内容及进度安排</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">/Course Content & Schedule</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">（</font></span><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Courier New';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">按照教学周编排，应包含每节课教学内容及教学目标，如有作业及考核要求，请一并列明）</font></span><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:176.7000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><div>本课程共设置 12 周教学周期，每周安排 3 课时，具体教学内容与进度如下：</div>
<div>周次&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 内容<br>&nbsp; 1.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;导论，饮食行为的生理基础：【实验演示】（望梅止渴、食物图片、VAS表、尝味实验）【思考与讨论1】为何不饿仍然会想吃东西，重点掌握：生物‑心理‑社会三维框架；饥饿饱感生理机制；生理饥饿与心理饥饿的区分</div>
<div>&nbsp; 2.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;食物感官与味觉、嗅觉等</div>
<div>&nbsp; 3.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;肠道激素与肠道营养感知</div>
<div>&nbsp; 4. &nbsp; &nbsp; 生命早期的饮食行为，相关基因：发展心理学视角。【翻转课堂：课前阅读相关文献】【案例分析】【思考与讨论2】&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>&nbsp; 5.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;国庆放假&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>&nbsp; 6. &nbsp; &nbsp; 饮食行为的文化与社会驱动：社会心理学视角&nbsp; 【思考与讨论3】</div>
<div>&nbsp; 7. &nbsp; &nbsp; 饮食营养与情绪：饮食‑情绪的双向循环——营养物质如何影响情绪与心理状态，情绪变化改变饮食选择【思考与讨论4】<br>&nbsp; 8.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;情绪性进食：机制、分类与测量方法<br>&nbsp; 9.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;饮食行为的环境触发：线索、情境、奖赏机制，进食决策、冲动进食、食物成瘾<br>&nbsp; 10. &nbsp; &nbsp; 饮食行为评估，饮食失调：限制性进食、暴饮暴食等；&nbsp;【案例分析】【小组ppt汇报】</div>
<div>&nbsp; 11. &nbsp; &nbsp; 饮食与认知功能<br>&nbsp; 12.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;饮食障碍：厌食症等【案例分析】</div>
<div>&nbsp; 13. &nbsp; &nbsp; 肥胖防治中针对饮食行为的干预策略<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
